  "idea": "LocalSend: share files between iPhone, Android, and PC with zero cables",
  "text": "How to transfer ten-gigabyte files in seconds between any device completely free. Uploading massive b-roll archives to WeTransfer or Dropbox eats up hourly limits and stalls your editing pipeline. Public cloud storage forces data through remote servers, creating frustrating bottlenecks on residential broadband. LocalSend bypasses external internet entirely, pushing data at maximum local router speed across your machines. You offload huge project files with zero fees or size restrictions.",
